    "Routing": "SpectType=2 with a Z-driving abscissa and no Force-flagged ordinate gives UNDEFINED_Z_DRIVING, so GetStiffness takes the force-distance path and not the Oliver-Pharr modulus path. Force is the channel named 'Force'; the abscissa is LastOrDefault(GetIsZDetector()), whose name list in SpectroscopyLineModel includes 'separation' - so it resolves to Separation, not Z Height. Trace is the first half of the samples and retrace the second, because the classifier is PS_PPT-only."
  },
